<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices steady - higher, ammonia up sharply.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices steady - higher, ammonia up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were mostly firmer while ammonia prices were up after lightning struck a large industrial producer and user, forcing it to bid higher for tight nearby supplies, a dealer said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   182-185			up 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188-190			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		 180			up 15</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
